# Calendar components

Canonical registry: `docs/ui-rules/component-registry.md` (Calendar / Planning section).
Full rules: `docs/ui-rules/patterns.md` § Calendar

## Primary component

Use **`<CalendarView>`** with `showSidebar` for the full planner (grid + team/calendar filters + mini picker).

## Mini month picker — critical

**Use `<CalendarMiniPicker>`** for jump-to-date / sidebar month grids.

```tsx
<CalendarMiniPicker selected={anchor} onSelect={setAnchor} />
```

**Never** style a sidebar picker by passing `classNames` to raw `<Calendar>`. All v9 grid + nav rules live in `calendar-mini-picker.tsx`.

Agent checklist (one-pass):

1. Sidebar jump date → `CalendarMiniPicker` or `CalendarSidebar` (not raw `Calendar`)
2. Week rows + weekday headers → both `grid grid-cols-7` (not flex + fixed widths)
3. Nav → in-flow top bar; no `absolute` on `button_previous` / `button_next`; no `navLayout="around"`
4. Selected day → `bg-cta` + `text-cta-foreground` only via `selected` class; no week-highlight modifiers with bg/ring on buttons
5. Sidebar toggles → `CalendarSidebarToggleRow` (native checkbox) for team AND calendars
6. Sidebar sections → `CalendarSidebarSection` (not `CollapsibleSection`)

## Sidebar

`CalendarView` + `showSidebar` renders `CalendarSidebar` (`w-60`, `lg:flex-col`). Toolbar sits over main grid only — not over sidebar.

## Event model

```ts
interface CalendarEvent {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  start: string;
  end: string;
  allDay?: boolean;
  calendarId?: string;
  colorKey?: CalendarColorKey;
  resourceId?: string;
}
```

Solid calendar color fills from `CALENDAR_COLOR_STYLES` — no side-accent-only styling.

## Module pattern

```tsx
<CalendarView
  anchor={anchor}
  onAnchorChange={setAnchor}
  view={view}
  onViewChange={setView}
  events={events}
  calendars={sources}
  teamMembers={teamMembers}
  showSidebar
  onEventClick={openEvent}
  onSlotClick={openCreateAt}
/>
```

## Don't

- Raw `<Calendar classNames={…}>` in sidebar — use `CalendarMiniPicker`
- Copy osiris `CalendarV2Sidebar` patterns into v3
- Split Day/Week/Month into separate pages
- FullCalendar or third-party schedulers
- `@phosphor-icons/react` in `apps/web` — use `@/lib/icons`
